  "answer": "Assuming NY Medicaid: the PDL (rev. 9/14/2026) marks these diabetes-related changes, none in effect yet (today is 10/14/2026):\n\n- **Preferred as of 10/22/2026 (marker 1):** glucagon HCl emergency kit, Gvoke (pen, syringe, vial), Humalog 100 U/mL (vial, pen, cartridge), Humalog Jr. 100 U/mL Kwikpen.\n- **Non-Preferred as of 10/22/2026 (marker 2):** insulin aspart (gen Novolog) cartridge, vial, pen.\n\nMarker placement is flattened in the text, so I couldn't confirm which exact items each marker covers. I didn't verify the SGLT2, DPP-4 or biguanide pages. Check the PDL itself before acting.",
